{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "21436252-607d-81ff-9416-e97e999d0329",
  "created_at": "2026-01-21T11:52:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carmen H. Quintero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:50:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing Office, this is Walter. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:50:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. I would like to ask about the mail ballot. How do I request it? I am not sure which form is correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:50:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. For a mail ballot you fill out an application. You can get it from our office or the state elections website, and then you return it to us signed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:50:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Signed by me only, or also by witness? I read something about witness, but maybe this is for different election."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The application itself just needs your signature. Any witness or notary question would be about the ballot envelope, and the instructions come with the ballot, so you'd follow those."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, so two different things. Okay. One moment please, I am mixing batter and the mixer is very loud. [pause] Sorry, I stopped it. Now I can hear you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And what ID is required? Do I send copy of my driver's license with the application? Or only when I vote?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally the application asks for an ID number, like a license number, and I believe the ballot packet explains if a copy is needed. Rules can differ for a mail ballot and for voting in person."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So license number on the form, and the other instructions come later. I think I understand. Still a little unsure about the ID for ballot itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. I can mail you the application and the instructions so you have both in front of you. Can I get your mailing address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, but I prefer to come to office. Is it open this afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, we're here until the end of the business day. Just ask at the counter for canvassing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:52:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. I will come. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
